1
00:00:00,315 --> 00:00:02,855
(Raj:)You have no idea. They're everywhere.

2
00:00:04,111 --> 00:00:07,491
(Howard:)Okay, guys, think.
How do we keep Raj in the country?

3
00:00:12,286 --> 00:00:15,456
PENNY [FROM OUTSIDE]:
Why doesn't he just get another job?

4
00:00:20,294 --> 00:00:25,344
(Howard(after Raj whispers to him):)What are you asking me for?
I don't know if you can talk now or not.

5
00:00:29,553 --> 00:00:30,843
(Raj:)Oh, beef.

6
00:00:31,013 --> 00:00:33,803
I'm gonna miss you so much.

7
00:00:34,683 --> 00:00:37,563
Did you know at the Mumbai McDonald's,
you can't get a Big Mac?

8
00:00:37,728 --> 00:00:39,768
(Raj:)All you can get
is a Chicken Maharaja Mac.

9
00:00:40,647 --> 00:00:41,857
And the special sauce?

10
00:00:42,024 --> 00:00:45,654
(Raj:)Curry. Which in India,
believe you me, is really not that special.

11
00:00:46,862 --> 00:00:50,702
(Leonard:)-Don't worry. You'll find another job.
-Yeah, let me start practicing for it.

12
00:00:50,866 --> 00:00:52,996
"Do you want fries
with that Maharaja Mac?"

13
00:00:54,369 --> 00:00:56,539
(Sheldon:)Hi, Leonard. Hello, Raj.

14
00:00:56,705 --> 00:00:58,535
(Raj:)Hello, Sheldon.

15
00:00:59,541 --> 00:01:02,211
(Sheldon:)Forgive me.
I'm not adept at reading facial cues.

